        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In China, AI is now used in movies and TV shows. In 2023, an AI "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "actor",
            "ref": "v-actor"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " first appeared in a TV show called "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "I Am Nobody"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Later, China also made its first short "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "drama",
            "ref": "v-drama"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fully",
            "ref": "v-fully"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " created by AI."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This year, media companies are using AI even more. One company created two AI actors. They look like real people and act like stars. They also have "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "online accounts",
            "zh": "在线账号"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and can post pictures to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "connect",
            "ref": "v-connect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with fans."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Another company made a big project with real actors’ faces and voices. These can be used to create AI shows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some people think AI actors will become more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "common",
            "ref": "v-common"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the future. Others "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "worry",
            "ref": "v-worry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that real actors may lose jobs. They believe real acting cannot be fully "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "replaced",
            "zh": "替代"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by machines. Many people also think AI is helpful in other ways. It can help with "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "editing",
            "zh": "剪辑"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and making "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "subtitles",
            "zh": "字幕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This makes movie work easier. However, people still believe real actors are important because they bring real feelings to stories."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
